Package: datamining
Title: Clean, Modular Data Mining Workflows and Algorithms in R
Version: 2.0.0
Authors@R: 
    person("Cihat", "Çoban", , "cihatcoban@users.noreply.github.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: A production-grade R data mining toolkit and reproducible notebook suite
    covering feature scaling, missing data analysis and imputation (Mean, Median, Mode,
    KNN, Random Forest), univariate and multivariate outlier detection (IQR Boxplot,
    Winsorization, Local Outlier Factor, K-Means Euclidean distance), and Naive Bayes
    classification with ROC/AUC evaluation. Built under the Keystone Engineering Framework.
